<p><span class="catchln" id="secs_7-351_to_7-358">Secs. 7-351 to 7-358. How apportioned on division of a town. On division of a town new receipts may be taken. Conditions of deposit. Custodian of fund; duties. Treasurer&#x0027;s bond and report of losses. Management. Release or assignment of security. Deficiency to be made good.</span> Sections <a href ="chap_107.htm#sec_7-351">7-351</a> to <a href ="chap_107.htm#sec_7-358">7-358</a>, inclusive, are repealed.</p>
